Hi,

I have released nilfs-2.0.18 standalone module.  This release
backported several bug fixes from the mainline kernel; the following
fixes are included:

 * fix hung on ARM-based target
 * fix oops in an error path of GC
 * fix possible hung at chcp operation due to lock order reversal
 * fix irregular checkpoint creation on small footprint systems

The updated package is available at http://www.nilfs.org/en/download.html

Thanks,
Ryusuke Konishi
